{"id":"75703316b975a2ec","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-finite-injury.md","title":"Finite Injury","display":"df-finite-injury — Finite Injury","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-finite-injury","aliases":["68-df-finite-injury"],"display":"df-finite-injury — Finite Injury","depends_on":["[[68-df-priority-argument]]"],"source_location":"not located in supplied Shoenfield PDF; local framework","verification_status":"local-framework-definition","source_proof_status":"not-a-book-theorem","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-finite-injury"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-finite-injury</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-injury — Finite Injury"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cd6ef5cb51a39c5\" href=\"?note=1cd6ef5cb51a39c5\" title=\"68-df-priority-argument\">68-df-priority-argument</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"not located in supplied Shoenfield PDF; local framework"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-framework-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-a-book-theorem"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,s\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inj}(b,e,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Inj}(b,e,s)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1cd6ef5cb51a39c5\" href=\"?note=1cd6ef5cb51a39c5\" title=\"68-df-priority-argument\">68-df-priority-argument</a> 中的较高优先行动重置约定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_b\">\\(I_b\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinInjury}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinInjury}\\)</span> 在以下定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_b(e,s):=\\bigl|\\{t&lt;s:\\mathrm{Inj}(b,e,t)\\}\\bigr|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_b(e,s):=\\bigl|\\{t&lt;s:\\mathrm{Inj}(b,e,t)\\}\\bigr|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinInjury}(b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\ge s_0\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Inj}(b,e,s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FinInjury}(b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\ge s_0\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Inj}(b,e,s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinInjury}(b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(I_b(e,s)\\le k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FinInjury}(b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(I_b(e,s)\\le k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给伤害计数以真正的累计事件语义，并把行动函数作为显式参数。两式等价：有限事件集有最大阶段；反之，若累计计数有界，每次伤害使计数严格增加，因此只能有有限次。不能对任意无单调性的数列 I(e,s) 作同一推断。本节点只定义本目录固定线性优先接口中的有限伤害，不声称任意有限伤害安排都能满足任意要求。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-priority-argument","status":"resolved","id":"1cd6ef5cb51a39c5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-priority-argument]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-priority-argument","status":"resolved","id":"1cd6ef5cb51a39c5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$，$e,s\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{Inj}(b,e,s)$ 采用 [[68-df-priority-argument]] 中的较高优先行动重置约定。$I_b$ 与 $\\mathrm{FinInjury}$ 在以下定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"e,s\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inj}(b,e,s)","display":false},{"tex":"I_b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinInjury}","display":false},{"tex":"I_b(e,s):=\\bigl|\\{t<s:\\mathrm{Inj}(b,e,t)\\}\\bigr|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinInjury}(b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\ge s_0\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Inj}(b,e,s).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinInjury}(b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(I_b(e,s)\\le k).","display":true}],"bytes":1461,"backlinks":[{"id":"0f48822de2ded7de","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{Inj}$ 与 $I_b$ 见 [[68-df-priority-argument]]、[[68-df-finite-injury]]；仍采用较高优先行动重置的固定接口。"},{"id":"893e72411706379e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))$，$a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{FinInjuryCompatible}$、$\\mathrm{FinInjury}$、$\\mathrm{RE}$ 分别见 [[68-df-finite-injury-compatibility]]、[[68-df-finite-injury]]、[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]。"},{"id":"fcd2a2bd1b358916","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[68-df-friedberg-muchnik-stages]] 唯一确定的阶段数据 $C_s$、$\\mathrm{FMAct}$、$\\alpha_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\beta_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\gamma_{\\mathrm{FM}}$ 及极限集合 $A_{\\mathrm{FM}},B_{\\mathrm{FM}}$。$\\mathrm{TotalRec}$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-function]]；$\\mathrm{FinInjury}$ 见 [[68-df-finite-injury]]；$\\mathrm{RE}$、$\\le_T$、$\\Phi_e^D$ 分别见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]、[[68-df-turing-reducibility]]、[[68-df-oracle-computation]]。$\\chi_D$ 沿用该 oracle 接口的集合表示函数。有限查询保持使用 [[68-thm-oracle-finite-use]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-65","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-finite-injury|df-finite-injury — Finite Injury]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-finite-injury]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-finite-injury|df-finite-injury — Finite Injury]]"}],"outgoing":["1cd6ef5cb51a39c5"]}